" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-ca956f4b-88c5-4557-874c-3a83dcc61ab6">어떤 기시감이 들었다</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-3b3b18be-c55b-4960-a9be-d6be415cf33d"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-fcea22d1-610f-4db4-8718-49eee77b56b2">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-5cb2109e-f2ad-4feb-96cc-ea635ca7ee5e"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-de0dba4a-4712-4a1c-bfb8-a201f9df0a35">기대하던 독일을 막상 갔을때는</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-cefcc949-eea3-46a5-8b19-51826bcfe365"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-a97b3043-3e29-4815-b7f9-5de6abf92a40">생각보다 기대 이하(위생..분위기 등..)여서</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-6fdcf001-4c8c-4eed-bc3b-a41c26d2df28"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-0175e646-2335-474a-ae4c-1fbb435a5d66">좀 실망을 하고 초반을 그냥저냥 살았는데</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-1610612a-dea0-4785-ba85-72b930a178f5"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-5d47cb21-4abd-4bd4-a5c1-559fa1af63f1">오히려 오길 잘했다고 생각이 들었던 순간은</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-5b4e29f8-6085-45c7-a0cb-1fe19e3333a3"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-dde30b22-7d30-4600-b556-f6dedffece8c">나라 자체가 아니라 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-d7499bff-518f-47ee-b3ff-5e931b50be6a"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-4736bd95-e419-4620-823f-2e912e7de52c">나라에서 만난 새로운 사람들 때문에 들었었다</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-5ef12eed-a299-4878-9748-798769796cb2"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-aa404b91-05b2-4598-9cb4-d953bf6789ae">사실 '오길 잘했다' 보다는 '만나길 잘했다'라는 표현이 더 적절했을지도</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-97c6cd8e-02e4-4b07-ba82-408c0b8eea12"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-60a4a84f-c516-47de-8e16-997d1b4fd552">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-68a392d1-6062-4bfc-99a8-641532a6fad7"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-cdb1494f-6af7-4b73-955d-573108b43621">근데 그걸 이제 새로운 사람 만날 기회가 많이 없으니까</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-aef23106-524c-46aa-835b-db839d0be843"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-957f6236-da4c-43e1-a22a-4c445d1ad6fe">잊고 살았는데</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-12db8682-08d9-4529-9c2d-3518624780ca"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-222e8344-945e-4a62-9d5d-ed3a7f30a406">팀장님과 대화를 많이 하면서 그때 그 기억이 다시 생각났다</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-aeaf8f2c-19f9-4849-a048-b83a4df2253b"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-7d709b37-54a3-46ab-9f0b-f99fc8fa9142">뭔가 인생 첫 회사가 여기여서 다행이다.. 라는 생각</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-5c6cef50-3fca-4c0f-82f4-71aa42adad27"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-84a85510-61d0-4378-b208-6eb318b1dafb">근데 그렇다고해서 영원히 있고 싶다는 아니고ㅎㅎ...</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-18dfe2d1-f2f7-4652-81ca-7cc50382a39d"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-0c22495c-4a71-4492-b6a0-6c45116caf6b">하여튼 그렇다고</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " style="" id="SE-57a7bb2f-479c-4ee3-af42-36b9331a8a80"><span style="" class="se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   " id="SE-f0846c7f-92ff-497f-9928-01af802ee3e5">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->
